      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 European Foot and Ankle Society. Published by Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a rare injury consisting of a neglected, irreducible, dislocation of the first metatarsophalangeal joint that was diagnosed 4 months after the injury. An open reduction was necessary from the beginning. Patient returned to full activity without pain or disability, so a good prognosis despite the delayed diagnosis was achieved. We are unaware of previous reports in the literature describing this unusual variant."
      },
